  "sameViewFlow": [
    "Only exact LOGIN_UI_V2 from original GSON admission selects the V2 service, no Swift approximation or second JS engine.",
    "Same View owns temporary state JSON, session inputs, actual typed controls, errors, action task, render/input/source generations and monotonic countdown tasks.",
    "Visible action form contains current controls only. Hidden prior inputs persist only in View session Map. Explicit row value, including empty, wins over current session and stored values.",
    "After source response, collect latest controls again; off-main pure projection rebases if actual input changes, without rerunning source JS. Candidate state commits only with successful form/error projection.",
    "Nullable choices keep adapter positions, exact raw nullable membership, first-choice fallback and setText(null) empty-string behavior.",
    "Typed source labels stay readonly; native Boolean Toggle, Menu choice selector, fields and existing source grid/theme retain normal accessibility and Dynamic Type conventions.",
    "Java exact action strings have UTF16 ASCII identities, independent from field keys; duplicate source label names use immutable per-render physical row IDs.",
    "No overlapping actions during render/action/cooldown. Only source button actions start countdown; ordinary toggle edits are retained on failed action.",
    "Checked service receipt precedes close, including legitimate close-only commands. V2 has no legacy OK or dismiss persistence.",
    "Native/interactive/system close cancels and actually drains its owned work. Source changes also await any old close owner before reloading, preventing the confirmed spinner race."
  ],
